# River mist off rapids and falls, spawned by the renderer's river mist producer (river_mist.cs.glsl) over the
# particle GPU spawn path: the producer sets position + velocity, so Rate/Speed/ConeAngle are unused here - only the
# look and the motion after spawn are authored. Rate 0 = no CPU spawns. ONE emitter: the producer spawns every
# request into the first one. World scale (no ocean scaling). No WaterFloor / AboveWater: those are the SEA's surface.
ParticleEffect RiverMist
	# Fine spray thrown off the whitewater: soft, drifts downstream with the water, rises a little and thins out.
	Emitter Mist
		Rate 0
		Life 1.5 3.5
		Gravity 0.4
		Drag 1.2
		Turbulence 0.8 0.5 0.4
		Size 0.4 2.5
		SizeVariance 0.3
		ColorStart 0.9, 0.93, 1.0, 0.14
		ColorEnd 0.9, 0.93, 1.0, 0
		Additivity 0
		FadeIn 0.6
		FadeOutStart 0.3
		SoftFade 0.6
		Lit true
		EmissiveFloor 0
		Spin 0.6
